# 2D notation: component paths in the K row, loop index i with a V entry,
# mixing 2D blocks and linear lines, comments in 2D rows.
# run: 1,2,3,4 => 10 / 4
P1 sum | (V)        ⇒ (R,     R)
     V |  0            0      1
     S |  2.2.8.0      16.0   8.0
  W1(2) [
    W1(2) [
       | R + V       ⇒ R        # accumulate
     V | 0   0         0
     K |     i0.i1
     A |              
    ]
  ]
       | V ⇒ R
     V | 0   1
     K | 1.1
END
